{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S05 只有18秒，却让两大串未标时点的感受词同时出现，还要配合三句叙述，容易让观众来不及消化从亲密到失重、孤立的关键转折。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的双栏布局更省眼力，短时间内扫过信息比较轻松；但 Y 用【】把每段心理变化的关键抓手直接凸显出来，更容易抓住人物当下的念头和行动动机。Y 的感受描写也更具体，身体、声响、水面和船的意象反复呼应，让开头的不安、过程中的沉醉与挣扎、结尾的平静形成连续的情绪轨迹。虽然部分短时段过密，整体仍是 Y 更能让观众既理解人物，又感受到音乐与心理变化之间的细腻联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6852606d-baf7-49d0-a1aa-16e1ec1d29d0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T172419404979Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:26:09.956495+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "586df5a752da30dd078aa3bfdf5b1c2b4f71e8f400391b902d9e3922b2b5238f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\